[{"id":"sajada-2-34-3","words":["verb:sajada"],"options":[{"bs":"učinite sedždu!","en":"(you all) prostrate!"},{"bs":"čine sedždu","en":"they prostrate"},{"bs":"čini sedždu","en":"he/it prostrates"},{"bs":"i učini sedždu!","en":"and prostrate!"}],"ref":"2:34","answerWord":"ٱسْجُدُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/4fc6eb29c94b1681db37.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when We said unto the angels: Prostrate yourselves before Adam, they fell prostrate, all save Iblis. He demurred through pride, and so became a disbeliever.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti sedždu","en":"to prostrate"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","قُلْنَا","لِلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةِ","ٱسْجُدُوا۟","لِءَادَمَ","فَسَجَدُوٓا۟","إِلَّآ","إِبْلِيسَ","أَبَىٰ","وَٱسْتَكْبَرَ","وَكَانَ","مِنَ","ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"سَجَدَ"}},{"id":"sajada-2-34-5","words":["verb:sajada"],"options":[{"bs":"pa su učinili sedždu","en":"so they prostrated"},{"bs":"da učinim sedždu","en":"so that I may prostrate"},{"bs":"zar činimo sedždu?","en":"do we prostrate?"},{"bs":"čini sedždu","en":"he/it prostrates"}],"ref":"2:34","answerWord":"فَسَجَدُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/d4778def732889cbb804.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when We said unto the angels: Prostrate yourselves before Adam, they fell prostrate, all save Iblis. He demurred through pride, and so became a disbeliever.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti sedždu","en":"to prostrate"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","قُلْنَا","لِلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةِ","ٱسْجُدُوا۟","لِءَادَمَ","فَسَجَدُوٓا۟","إِلَّآ","إِبْلِيسَ","أَبَىٰ","وَٱسْتَكْبَرَ","وَكَانَ","مِنَ","ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"سَجَدَ"}},{"id":"sajada-84-21-5","words":["verb:sajada"],"options":[{"bs":"čine sedždu","en":"they prostrate"},{"bs":"učinite sedždu!","en":"(you all) prostrate!"},{"bs":"čine sedždu (oboje)","en":"(both) prostrate"},{"bs":"da učinim sedždu","en":"so that I may prostrate"}],"ref":"84:21","answerWord":"يَسْجُدُونَ","answerSound":"audio/6defaa315e3f0c80796e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And, when the Qur'an is recited unto them, worship not (Allah)?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti sedždu","en":"to prostrate"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","قُرِئَ","عَلَيْهِمُ","ٱلْقُرْءَانُ","لَا","يَسْجُدُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"سَجَدَ"}},{"id":"sajada-13-15-1","words":["verb:sajada"],"options":[{"bs":"čini sedždu","en":"he/it prostrates"},{"bs":"zar činim sedždu?","en":"do I prostrate?"},{"bs":"pa učinite sedždu","en":"so prostrate"},{"bs":"i učini sedždu!","en":"and prostrate!"}],"ref":"13:15","answerWord":"يَسْجُدُ","answerSound":"audio/9982820a09adcc1aeba3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And unto Allah falleth prostrate whosoever is in the heavens and the earth, willingly or unwillingly, as do their shadows in the morning and the evening hours.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti sedždu","en":"to prostrate"},"passage":["وَلِلَّهِ","يَسْجُدُ","مَن","فِى","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","طَوْعًا","وَكَرْهًا","وَظِلَٰلُهُم","بِٱلْغُدُوِّ","وَٱلْءَاصَالِ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"سَجَدَ"}},{"id":"sajada-15-30-0","words":["verb:sajada"],"options":[{"bs":"pa su učinili sedždu","en":"so (they) prostrated"},{"bs":"pa učinite sedždu","en":"so prostrate"},{"bs":"činite sedždu","en":"you (all) prostrate"},{"bs":"čine sedždu","en":"they prostrate"}],"ref":"15:30","answerWord":"فَسَجَدَ","answerSound":"audio/df5c86475a4244c7d5aa.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So the angels fell prostrate, all of them together","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti sedždu","en":"to prostrate"},"passage":["فَسَجَدَ","ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةُ","كُلُّهُمْ","أَجْمَعُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"سَجَدَ"}},{"id":"sajada-22-77-4","words":["verb:sajada"],"options":[{"bs":"i učinite sedždu!","en":"and (you all) prostrate!"},{"bs":"učinili su sedždu","en":"they prostrated"},{"bs":"da učinim sedždu","en":"so that I may prostrate"},{"bs":"pa su učinili sedždu","en":"so (they) prostrated"}],"ref":"22:77","answerWord":"وَٱسْجُدُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/9e8a0ae103fd9d489502.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! Bow down and prostrate yourselves, and worship your Lord, and do good, that haply ye may prosper.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti sedždu","en":"to prostrate"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","ٱرْكَعُوا۟","وَٱسْجُدُوا۟","وَٱعْبُدُوا۟","رَبَّكُمْ","وَٱفْعَلُوا۟","ٱلْخَيْرَ","لَعَلَّكُمْ","تُفْلِحُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"سَجَدَ"}},{"id":"sajada-3-43-3","words":["verb:sajada"],"options":[{"bs":"i učini sedždu!","en":"and prostrate!"},{"bs":"pa učinite sedždu","en":"so prostrate"},{"bs":"čine sedždu (oboje)","en":"(both) prostrate"},{"bs":"čini sedždu","en":"he/it prostrates"}],"ref":"3:43","answerWord":"وَٱسْجُدِى","answerSound":"audio/f21523d8a9ef7a9fd6c5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O Mary! Be obedient to thy Lord, prostrate thyself and bow with those who bow (in worship).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti sedždu","en":"to prostrate"},"passage":["يَٰمَرْيَمُ","ٱقْنُتِى","لِرَبِّكِ","وَٱسْجُدِى","وَٱرْكَعِى","مَعَ","ٱلرَّٰكِعِينَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"سَجَدَ"}},{"id":"sajada-15-33-3","words":["verb:sajada"],"options":[{"bs":"da učinim sedždu","en":"so that I may prostrate"},{"bs":"čine sedždu","en":"they prostrate"},{"bs":"učinili su sedždu","en":"they prostrated"},{"bs":"čine sedždu (oboje)","en":"(both) prostrate"}],"ref":"15:33","answerWord":"لِّأَسْجُدَ","answerSound":"audio/45425117a18a3a620a06.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: I am not one to prostrate myself unto a mortal whom Thou hast created out of potter's clay of black mud altered!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti sedždu","en":"to prostrate"},"passage":["قَالَ","لَمْ","أَكُن","لِّأَسْجُدَ","لِبَشَرٍ","خَلَقْتَهُۥ","مِن","صَلْصَٰلٍ","مِّنْ","حَمَإٍ","مَّسْنُونٍ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"سَجَدَ"}},{"id":"sajada-17-61-9","words":["verb:sajada"],"options":[{"bs":"zar činim sedždu?","en":"do I prostrate?"},{"bs":"i učinite sedždu!","en":"and (you all) prostrate!"},{"bs":"učinili su sedždu","en":"they prostrated"},{"bs":"pa su učinili sedždu","en":"so (they) prostrated"}],"ref":"17:61","answerWord":"ءَأَسْجُدُ","answerSound":"audio/5bb7e2c6afcd57cbb5bf.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when We said unto the angels: Fall down prostrate before Adam and they fell prostrate all save Iblis, he said: Shall I fall prostrate before that which Thou hast created of clay?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti sedždu","en":"to prostrate"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","قُلْنَا","لِلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةِ","ٱسْجُدُوا۟","لِءَادَمَ","فَسَجَدُوٓا۟","إِلَّآ","إِبْلِيسَ","قَالَ","ءَأَسْجُدُ","لِمَنْ","خَلَقْتَ","طِينًا"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"سَجَدَ"}},{"id":"sajada-25-60-8","words":["verb:sajada"],"options":[{"bs":"zar činimo sedždu?","en":"do we prostrate?"},{"bs":"učinite sedždu!","en":"(you all) prostrate!"},{"bs":"čine sedždu","en":"they prostrate"},{"bs":"da učinim sedždu","en":"so that I may prostrate"}],"ref":"25:60","answerWord":"أَنَسْجُدُ","answerSound":"audio/885a81c9352658b7d558.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when it is said unto them: Prostrate to the Beneficent! they say: And what is the Beneficent? Are we to prostrate to whatever thou (Muhammad) biddest us? And it increaseth aversion in them.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti sedždu","en":"to prostrate"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","قِيلَ","لَهُمُ","ٱسْجُدُوا۟","لِلرَّحْمَٰنِ","قَالُوا۟","وَمَا","ٱلرَّحْمَٰنُ","أَنَسْجُدُ","لِمَا","تَأْمُرُنَا","وَزَادَهُمْ","نُفُورًا"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"سَجَدَ"}},{"id":"sajada-27-25-1","words":["verb:sajada"],"options":[{"bs":"čine sedždu","en":"they prostrate"},{"bs":"činite sedždu","en":"you (all) prostrate"},{"bs":"pa su učinili sedždu","en":"so they prostrated"},{"bs":"čine sedždu (oboje)","en":"(both) prostrate"}],"ref":"27:25","answerWord":"يَسْجُدُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/5ade38dd92543a9364af.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So that they worship not Allah, Who bringeth forth the hidden in the heavens and the earth, and knoweth what ye hide and what ye proclaim,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti sedždu","en":"to prostrate"},"passage":["أَلَّا","يَسْجُدُوا۟","لِلَّهِ","ٱلَّذِى","يُخْرِجُ","ٱلْخَبْءَ","فِى","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","وَيَعْلَمُ","مَا","تُخْفُونَ","وَمَا","تُعْلِنُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"سَجَدَ"}},{"id":"sajada-41-37-7","words":["verb:sajada"],"options":[{"bs":"činite sedždu","en":"you (all) prostrate"},{"bs":"čine sedždu","en":"they prostrate"},{"bs":"učinili su sedždu","en":"they prostrated"},{"bs":"i učinite sedždu!","en":"and (you all) prostrate!"}],"ref":"41:37","answerWord":"تَسْجُدُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/5adb040e1bd9e7c5758c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And of His portents are the night and the day and the sun and the moon. Do not prostrate to the sun or the moon; but prostrate to Allah Who created them, if it is in truth Him Whom ye worship.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti sedždu","en":"to prostrate"},"passage":["وَمِنْ","ءَايَٰتِهِ","ٱلَّيْلُ","وَٱلنَّهَارُ","وَٱلشَّمْسُ","وَٱلْقَمَرُ","لَا","تَسْجُدُوا۟","لِلشَّمْسِ","وَلَا","لِلْقَمَرِ","وَٱسْجُدُوا۟","لِلَّهِ","ٱلَّذِى","خَلَقَهُنَّ","إِن","كُنتُمْ","إِيَّاهُ","تَعْبُدُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"سَجَدَ"}},{"id":"sajada-53-62-0","words":["verb:sajada"],"options":[{"bs":"pa učinite sedždu","en":"so prostrate"},{"bs":"čine sedždu","en":"they prostrate"},{"bs":"učinili su sedždu","en":"they prostrated"},{"bs":"i učini sedždu!","en":"and prostrate!"}],"ref":"53:62","answerWord":"فَٱسْجُدُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/d6bc858b0a799286ccbd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Rather prostrate yourselves before Allah and serve Him.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti sedždu","en":"to prostrate"},"passage":["فَٱسْجُدُوا۟","لِلَّهِ","وَٱعْبُدُوا۟"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"سَجَدَ"}},{"id":"sajada-76-26-2","words":["verb:sajada"],"options":[{"bs":"pa učini sedždu!","en":"so prostrate!"},{"bs":"zar činimo sedždu?","en":"do we prostrate?"},{"bs":"učinili su sedždu","en":"they prostrated"},{"bs":"i učinite sedždu!","en":"and (you all) prostrate!"}],"ref":"76:26","answerWord":"فَٱسْجُدْ","answerSound":"audio/1e4a0c9c2604a550d5c0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And worship Him (a portion) of the night. And glorify Him through the livelong night.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti sedždu","en":"to prostrate"},"passage":["وَمِنَ","ٱلَّيْلِ","فَٱسْجُدْ","لَهُۥ","وَسَبِّحْهُ","لَيْلًا","طَوِيلًا"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"سَجَدَ"}},{"id":"sajada-96-19-3","words":["verb:sajada"],"options":[{"bs":"i učini sedždu!","en":"and prostrate!"},{"bs":"čine sedždu","en":"they prostrate"},{"bs":"pa su učinili sedždu","en":"so they prostrated"},{"bs":"zar činim sedždu?","en":"do I prostrate?"}],"ref":"96:19","answerWord":"وَٱسْجُدْ","answerSound":"audio/67b378e373f9a9106cd0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Nay, Obey not thou him. But prostrate thyself, and draw near (unto Allah).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"učiniti sedždu","en":"to prostrate"},"passage":["كَلَّا","لَا","تُطِعْهُ","وَٱسْجُدْ","وَٱقْتَرِب"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"سَجَدَ"}},{"id":"sarafa-9-127-14","words":["verb:sarafa"],"options":[{"bs":"odvratio je","en":"he/it turned away"},{"bs":"odvratio vas je","en":"he/it turned you (all) away"},{"bs":"i odvraća ga","en":"and he/it turns it away"},{"bs":"odvratit ću","en":"I will turn away"}],"ref":"9:127","answerWord":"صَرَفَ","answerSound":"audio/2f0f2810f968df29d472.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And whenever a surah is revealed, they look one at another (as who should say): Doth anybody see you? Then they turn away. Allah turneth away their hearts because they are a folk who understand not.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odvratiti, okrenuti","en":"to turn away, to avert"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","مَآ","أُنزِلَتْ","سُورَةٌ","نَّظَرَ","بَعْضُهُمْ","إِلَىٰ","بَعْضٍ","هَلْ","يَرَىٰكُم","مِّنْ","أَحَدٍ","ثُمَّ","ٱنصَرَفُوا۟","صَرَفَ","ٱللَّهُ","قُلُوبَهُم","بِأَنَّهُمْ","قَوْمٌ","لَّا","يَفْقَهُونَ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"صَرَفَ"}},{"id":"sarafa-12-24-11","words":["verb:sarafa"],"options":[{"bs":"da odvratimo","en":"so that we may turn away"},{"bs":"odvratio vas je","en":"he/it turned you (all) away"},{"bs":"usmjerili smo","en":"we directed"},{"bs":"odvratit ću","en":"I will turn away"}],"ref":"12:24","answerWord":"لِنَصْرِفَ","answerSound":"audio/17a7d8b768c4e1b7d475.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"She verily desired him, and he would have desired her if it had not been that he saw the argument of his Lord. Thus it was, that We might ward off from him evil and lewdness. Lo! he was of Our chosen slaves.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odvratiti, okrenuti","en":"to turn away, to avert"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","هَمَّتْ","بِهِۦ","وَهَمَّ","بِهَا","لَوْلَآ","أَن","رَّءَا","بُرْهَٰنَ","رَبِّهِۦ","كَذَٰلِكَ","لِنَصْرِفَ","عَنْهُ","ٱلسُّوٓءَ","وَٱلْفَحْشَآءَ","إِنَّهُۥ","مِنْ","عِبَادِنَا","ٱلْمُخْلَصِينَ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"صَرَفَ"}},{"id":"sarafa-12-34-3","words":["verb:sarafa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa je odvratio","en":"so He turned away"},{"bs":"i odvraća ga","en":"and he/it turns it away"},{"bs":"odvratit ću","en":"I will turn away"},{"bs":"odvratio vas je","en":"he/it turned you (all) away"}],"ref":"12:34","answerWord":"فَصَرَفَ","answerSound":"audio/dd08e341981fc60651f1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So his Lord heard his prayer and fended off their wiles from him. Lo! He is Hearer, Knower.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odvratiti, okrenuti","en":"to turn away, to avert"},"passage":["فَٱسْتَجَابَ","لَهُۥ","رَبُّهُۥ","فَصَرَفَ","عَنْهُ","كَيْدَهُنَّ","إِنَّهُۥ","هُوَ","ٱلسَّمِيعُ","ٱلْعَلِيمُ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"صَرَفَ"}},{"id":"sarafa-25-65-3","words":["verb:sarafa"],"options":[{"bs":"odvrati","en":"turn away"},{"bs":"odvratio vas je","en":"he/it turned you (all) away"},{"bs":"odvratit ću","en":"I will turn away"},{"bs":"usmjerili smo","en":"we directed"}],"ref":"25:65","answerWord":"ٱصْرِفْ","answerSound":"audio/ad13401d703ca7b2c1b8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And who say: Our Lord! Avert from us the doom of hell; lo! the doom thereof is anguish;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odvratiti, okrenuti","en":"to turn away, to avert"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","يَقُولُونَ","رَبَّنَا","ٱصْرِفْ","عَنَّا","عَذَابَ","جَهَنَّمَ","إِنَّ","عَذَابَهَا","كَانَ","غَرَامًا"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"صَرَفَ"}},{"id":"sarafa-46-29-1","words":["verb:sarafa"],"options":[{"bs":"usmjerili smo","en":"we directed"},{"bs":"pa je odvratio","en":"so He turned away"},{"bs":"i odvraća ga","en":"and he/it turns it away"},{"bs":"odvratit ću","en":"I will turn away"}],"ref":"46:29","answerWord":"صَرَفْنَآ","answerSound":"audio/69fc7722ecd3d73b075f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when We inclined toward thee (Muhammad) certain of the jinn, who wished to hear the Qur'an and, when they were in its presence, said: Give ear! and, when it was finished, turned back to their people, warning.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odvratiti, okrenuti","en":"to turn away, to avert"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","صَرَفْنَآ","إِلَيْكَ","نَفَرًا","مِّنَ","ٱلْجِنِّ","يَسْتَمِعُونَ","ٱلْقُرْءَانَ","فَلَمَّا","حَضَرُوهُ","قَالُوٓا۟","أَنصِتُوا۟","فَلَمَّا","قُضِىَ","وَلَّوْا۟","إِلَىٰ","قَوْمِهِم","مُّنذِرِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"صَرَفَ"}},{"id":"bana-37-97-1","words":["verb:bana"],"options":[{"bs":"sagradite","en":"build"},{"bs":"zar gradite","en":"do you build"},{"bs":"sagradili su","en":"they built"},{"bs":"i sagradili smo","en":"and we built"}],"ref":"37:97","answerWord":"ٱبْنُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/16530c736d6e4e818b59.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They said: Build for him a building and fling him in the red-hotfire.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"graditi, sagraditi","en":"to build"},"passage":["قَالُوا۟","ٱبْنُوا۟","لَهُۥ","بُنْيَٰنًا","فَأَلْقُوهُ","فِى","ٱلْجَحِيمِ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"بَنَى"}},{"id":"bana-40-36-3","words":["verb:bana"],"options":[{"bs":"gradi!","en":"build!"},{"bs":"sagradili smo ga","en":"we built it"},{"bs":"i sagradili smo","en":"and we built"},{"bs":"zar gradite","en":"do you build"}],"ref":"40:36","answerWord":"ٱبْنِ","answerSound":"audio/4685887dcfa9ee634cd9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And Pharaoh said: O Haman! Build for me a tower that haply I may reach the roads,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"graditi, sagraditi","en":"to build"},"passage":["وَقَالَ","فِرْعَوْنُ","يَٰهَٰمَٰنُ","ٱبْنِ","لِى","صَرْحًا","لَّعَلِّىٓ","أَبْلُغُ","ٱلْأَسْبَٰبَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"بَنَى"}},{"id":"bana-50-6-6","words":["verb:bana"],"options":[{"bs":"sagradili smo ga","en":"we built it"},{"bs":"sagradite","en":"build"},{"bs":"sagradili su","en":"they built"},{"bs":"i sagradili smo","en":"and we built"}],"ref":"50:6","answerWord":"بَنَيْنَٰهَا","answerSound":"audio/1b81f00dbcd0944d31cd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Have they not then observed the sky above them, how We have constructed it and beautified it, and how there are no rifts therein?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"graditi, sagraditi","en":"to build"},"passage":["أَفَلَمْ","يَنظُرُوٓا۟","إِلَى","ٱلسَّمَآءِ","فَوْقَهُمْ","كَيْفَ","بَنَيْنَٰهَا","وَزَيَّنَّٰهَا","وَمَا","لَهَا","مِن","فُرُوجٍ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"بَنَى"}},{"id":"bana-9-110-4","words":["verb:bana"],"options":[{"bs":"sagradili su","en":"they built"},{"bs":"sagradite","en":"build"},{"bs":"i sagradili smo","en":"and we built"},{"bs":"sagradili smo ga","en":"we built it"}],"ref":"9:110","answerWord":"بَنَوْا۟","answerSound":"audio/9509d061620acc68f45f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The building which they built will never cease to be a misgiving in their hearts unless their hearts be torn to pieces. Allah is Knower, Wise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"graditi, sagraditi","en":"to build"},"passage":["لَا","يَزَالُ","بُنْيَٰنُهُمُ","ٱلَّذِى","بَنَوْا۟","رِيبَةً","فِى","قُلُوبِهِمْ","إِلَّآ","أَن","تَقَطَّعَ","قُلُوبُهُمْ","وَٱللَّهُ","عَلِيمٌ","حَكِيمٌ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"بَنَى"}},{"id":"bana-26-128-0","words":["verb:bana"],"options":[{"bs":"zar gradite","en":"do you build"},{"bs":"sagradite","en":"build"},{"bs":"sagradili su","en":"they built"},{"bs":"sagradili smo ga","en":"we built it"}],"ref":"26:128","answerWord":"أَتَبْنُونَ","answerSound":"audio/28bc71a8e4599bc521a3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Build ye on every high place a monument for vain delight?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"graditi, sagraditi","en":"to build"},"passage":["أَتَبْنُونَ","بِكُلِّ","رِيعٍ","ءَايَةً","تَعْبَثُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"بَنَى"}},{"id":"bana-78-12-0","words":["verb:bana"],"options":[{"bs":"i sagradili smo","en":"and we built"},{"bs":"sagradili su","en":"they built"},{"bs":"sagradite","en":"build"},{"bs":"zar gradite","en":"do you build"}],"ref":"78:12","answerWord":"وَبَنَيْنَا","answerSound":"audio/e377f182be7d1c0cea4d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We have built above you seven strong (heavens),","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"graditi, sagraditi","en":"to build"},"passage":["وَبَنَيْنَا","فَوْقَكُمْ","سَبْعًا","شِدَادًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"بَنَى"}},{"id":"saddaqa-37-37-3","words":["verb:saddaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"i potvrdio je","en":"and he/it confirmed"},{"bs":"vjeruju","en":"they believe"},{"bs":"i povjerovala je","en":"and she/it believed"},{"bs":"ispunio si","en":"you fulfilled"}],"ref":"37:37","answerWord":"وَصَدَّقَ","answerSound":"audio/ecef7a20db7308f98a83.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Nay, but he brought the Truth, and he confirmed those sent (before him).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati, potvrditi","en":"to believe, to confirm"},"passage":["بَلْ","جَآءَ","بِٱلْحَقِّ","وَصَدَّقَ","ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"صَدَّقَ"}},{"id":"saddaqa-28-34-9","words":["verb:saddaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"potvrđuje me","en":"he/it confirms me"},{"bs":"ispunio si","en":"you fulfilled"},{"bs":"i potvrdio je","en":"and he/it confirmed"},{"bs":"vjerujete","en":"you believe"}],"ref":"28:34","answerWord":"يُصَدِّقُنِىٓ","answerSound":"audio/7dea2822c86ba4db8c81.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"My brother Aaron is more eloquent than me in speech. Therefor send him with me as a helper to confirm me. Lo! I fear that they will give the lie to me.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati, potvrditi","en":"to believe, to confirm"},"passage":["وَأَخِى","هَٰرُونُ","هُوَ","أَفْصَحُ","مِنِّى","لِسَانًا","فَأَرْسِلْهُ","مَعِىَ","رِدْءًا","يُصَدِّقُنِىٓ","إِنِّىٓ","أَخَافُ","أَن","يُكَذِّبُونِ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"صَدَّقَ"}},{"id":"saddaqa-37-105-1","words":["verb:saddaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"ispunio si","en":"you fulfilled"},{"bs":"potvrđuje me","en":"he/it confirms me"},{"bs":"i potvrdio je","en":"and he/it confirmed"},{"bs":"i povjerovala je","en":"and she/it believed"}],"ref":"37:105","answerWord":"صَدَّقْتَ","answerSound":"audio/44b2efd41c8d31ca92d2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Thou hast already fulfilled the vision. Lo! thus do We reward the good.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati, potvrditi","en":"to believe, to confirm"},"passage":["قَدْ","صَدَّقْتَ","ٱلرُّءْيَآ","إِنَّا","كَذَٰلِكَ","نَجْزِى","ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"صَدَّقَ"}},{"id":"saddaqa-56-57-3","words":["verb:saddaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"vjerujete","en":"you believe"},{"bs":"potvrđuje me","en":"he/it confirms me"},{"bs":"i povjerovala je","en":"and she/it believed"},{"bs":"i potvrdio je","en":"and he/it confirmed"}],"ref":"56:57","answerWord":"تُصَدِّقُونَ","answerSound":"audio/8d46e2550981af0ec9d5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"We created you. Will ye then admit the truth?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati, potvrditi","en":"to believe, to confirm"},"passage":["نَحْنُ","خَلَقْنَٰكُمْ","فَلَوْلَا","تُصَدِّقُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"صَدَّقَ"}},{"id":"saddaqa-66-12-10","words":["verb:saddaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"i povjerovala je","en":"and she/it believed"},{"bs":"i potvrdio je","en":"and he/it confirmed"},{"bs":"vjerujete","en":"you believe"},{"bs":"ispunio si","en":"you fulfilled"}],"ref":"66:12","answerWord":"وَصَدَّقَتْ","answerSound":"audio/69b976b4bbc92de57952.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And Mary, daughter of 'Imran, whose body was chaste, therefor We breathed therein something of Our Spirit. And she put faith in the words of her Lord and His scriptures, and was of the obedient.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati, potvrditi","en":"to believe, to confirm"},"passage":["وَمَرْيَمَ","ٱبْنَتَ","عِمْرَٰنَ","ٱلَّتِىٓ","أَحْصَنَتْ","فَرْجَهَا","فَنَفَخْنَا","فِيهِ","مِن","رُّوحِنَا","وَصَدَّقَتْ","بِكَلِمَٰتِ","رَبِّهَا","وَكُتُبِهِۦ","وَكَانَتْ","مِنَ","ٱلْقَٰنِتِينَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"صَدَّقَ"}},{"id":"saddaqa-70-26-1","words":["verb:saddaqa"],"options":[{"bs":"vjeruju","en":"they believe"},{"bs":"i potvrdio je","en":"and he/it confirmed"},{"bs":"ispunio si","en":"you fulfilled"},{"bs":"potvrđuje me","en":"he/it confirms me"}],"ref":"70:26","answerWord":"يُصَدِّقُونَ","answerSound":"audio/17696333674b5ed6e3ff.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And those who believe in the Day of Judgment,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"vjerovati, potvrditi","en":"to believe, to confirm"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","يُصَدِّقُونَ","بِيَوْمِ","ٱلدِّينِ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"صَدَّقَ"}}]